    "Campaign: every transaction where the router pulled an approved token from an owner other than the sender (Approval events with the router as spender). Before the anchor, pulls since block 20,000,000 were all by the owners and no earlier transaction pulled from two owners. Tokens emitting no Approval on transferFrom are missed.",
    "Loss: victims' pulled input tokens, priced at DefiLlama's daily price nearest each pull; BUSD, USDT and USDC without a DefiLlama datapoint at par. 60 small tokens with no DefiLlama price are not valued, so the total is a lower bound. The tokens victims received in exchange are not netted."
